    "detailed_description": "<h1>WE RECOMMEND YOU TO CHECK THESE GAMES...</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1656091581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1656091581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1656091581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i>How far can you go to earn lots of money? Act quickly and efficiently as a thief who robs houses in a nearby neighborhood will allow you to develop your logical and quick-thinking skills. Get to the property, take as much as you can and manage to escape from the police.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83c\udf92 The actual load capacity of the backpack and varied stealing methods<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfae Interesting mini-games during the gameplay<br></li><li>\ud83d\udc40 Try to steal as much as possible without being noticed<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfac Addictive and engaging storyline<br></li><li>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Non-linear levels that can be passed in many ways<br></li><li>\ud83d\udcb8 Sell the stolen loot and increase statistics<br></li><li>\ud83d\ude94 Don't let the police catch you</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/86e33552975e81326eab2436f35f2614.poster.avif?t=1656091581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/86e33552975e81326eab2436f35f2614.webm?t=1656091581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/86e33552975e81326eab2436f35f2614.mp4?t=1656091581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Play the role of a withdrawn man who uses illegal methods to avoid revealing his lies. To earn more money, he decides to break into an inconspicuous house, after which his life will turn 180 degrees. Countless difficulties await you on the road that only the smartest can overcome. Time is running out, be wise and stay undetected!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/8b58418e91f887dcc3b967020b9a86f9.poster.avif?t=1656091581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/8b58418e91f887dcc3b967020b9a86f9.webm?t=1656091581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/8b58418e91f887dcc3b967020b9a86f9.mp4?t=1656091581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Have eyes around your head. Housebreaker has mysterious puzzles hidden throughout the map that, when uncovered, can have a tangible impact on your gameplay. You can learn a lot of additional information about your goals that are not directly told in the story.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/598fa96331953451f44654dbeb2ebde3.poster.avif?t=1656091581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/598fa96331953451f44654dbeb2ebde3.webm?t=1656091581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/598fa96331953451f44654dbeb2ebde3.mp4?t=1656091581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Enter and explore a new world full of exciting challenges and mini-games. Do your best to complete additional quests, catch as much loot as possible, and not get caught by the susceptible homeowners.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/97afd98ca49b020c3a8d24b8e663b916.poster.avif?t=1656091581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/97afd98ca49b020c3a8d24b8e663b916.webm?t=1656091581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/97afd98ca49b020c3a8d24b8e663b916.mp4?t=1656091581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Collect valuable loot during a break-in, which you can later sell, and use the money earned to develop equipment and skills in your hideout. Along with the experience gained, you will be able to buy better tools that will enable break-ins on the most guarded properties.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/e5d4c4ea539692131d4bb0b0dbecdee1.poster.avif?t=1656091581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/e5d4c4ea539692131d4bb0b0dbecdee1.webm?t=1656091581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/e5d4c4ea539692131d4bb0b0dbecdee1.mp4?t=1656091581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>There is no rule as to the place of action. Initially, they are private houses, gardens, and farms, but as you progress, you will receive orders in areas such as apartments, villas, council buildings, or military and government facilities.<br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1656091581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1656091581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1656091581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i>How far can you go to earn lots of money? Act quickly and efficiently as a thief who robs houses in a nearby neighborhood will allow you to develop your logical and quick-thinking skills. Get to the property, take as much as you can and manage to escape from the police.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83c\udf92 The actual load capacity of the backpack and varied stealing methods<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfae Interesting mini-games during the gameplay<br></li><li>\ud83d\udc40 Try to steal as much as possible without being noticed<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfac Addictive and engaging storyline<br></li><li>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Non-linear levels that can be passed in many ways<br></li><li>\ud83d\udcb8 Sell the stolen loot and increase statistics<br></li><li>\ud83d\ude94 Don't let the police catch you</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/86e33552975e81326eab2436f35f2614.poster.avif?t=1656091581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/86e33552975e81326eab2436f35f2614.webm?t=1656091581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extr