ditional quests, catch as much loot as possible, and not get caught by the susceptible homeowners.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/97afd98ca49b020c3a8d24b8e663b916.poster.avif?t=1656091581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/97afd98ca49b020c3a8d24b8e663b916.webm?t=1656091581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/97afd98ca49b020c3a8d24b8e663b916.mp4?t=1656091581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Collect valuable loot during a break-in, which you can later sell, and use the money earned to develop equipment and skills in your hideout. Along with the experience gained, you will be able to buy better tools that will enable break-ins on the most guarded properties.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/e5d4c4ea539692131d4bb0b0dbecdee1.poster.avif?t=1656091581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/e5d4c4ea539692131d4bb0b0dbecdee1.webm?t=1656091581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250090/extras/e5d4c4ea539692131d4bb0b0dbecdee1.mp4?t=1656091581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>There is no rule as to the place of action. Initially, they are private houses, gardens, and farms, but as you progress, you will receive orders in areas such as apartments, villas, council buildings, or military and government facilities.<br><br>",
